cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "cad-deliver-mcp: a pre-delivery gatekeeper for LLM-generated CAD drawings"
abstract: >-
  An offline verification gatekeeper for CAD artefacts produced by LLM agents.
  It parses DXF, DWG, PDF, STEP and review reports without launching a commercial
  CAD runtime, evaluates geometric integrity and GB/T drafting-standard
  compliance, and returns one of three verdicts: PASS, FAIL, or UNKNOWN.
  UNKNOWN is a terminal state, never a pass: a dimension that could not be
  inspected blocks delivery instead of silently succeeding.
type: software
authors:
